# Generated corpora. The frozen slice is committed on purpose: it is what CI
# gates on, and a regression gate that regenerates its own reference set is
# not a gate. Everything else is reproducible from a seed and a manifest.
data/corpus/*
!data/corpus/frozen/
!data/corpus/holdout/

